# Two Bonehoard Dracosaurs: at Bot1's upkeep on turn 5 both trigger and resolve one after the other, each exiling the
# next two cards of the library and judging only its own two. One pair is two Islands (a Dinosaur, no Treasure), the
# other Lightning Bolt and Sol Ring (a Treasure, no Dinosaur), so whichever resolves first, the board gets exactly one
# more Dinosaur and one Treasure, and all four cards are exiled. On turn 3 only the first Dracosaur was there (two
# Islands: its Dinosaur); the second is cast that turn with Mox Sapphire drawn for it.

